4
00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:18.000
Beauty is nothing tangible. It only exists in our heads as a pleasant feeling.

5
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:22.550
If we have to define, we perceive something as beautiful.

6
00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:25.230
If it's color shape for more proportion,

7
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.830
somehow are appealing or delightful to us.

8
