identifying and assessing these things. And phenomen correctly used to be vital.

27
00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:49.150
Do those clouds mean rain will come soon? Are these waters safe to swim through?

28
00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:54.110
Can I eat this? Another pervasive thing is symmetry in nature.

29
00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:58.950
It means everything is as it should be stems and trees and leaves and blossoms

30
00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:00.110
all grow symmetrically.

31
